Z||000005||MrPBody||06-09-2001||10:28 AM||||If there's no room for your left foot, prop it on the wheelwell hump.  There's a plastic wear pad to protect the carpet.<P>If you think a Fiero has no foot room, try driving an old Lotus.  I haven't driven one for years, but I always had to remove one shoe to operate the pedals.<BR>||||reg||1
